  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UTH Center of Learning and Research 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the fund is to maintain U Thant House as a centre for research, learning and dialogue focused on the key challenges facing Myanmar today, and to help the people of Myanmar reimagine peace and rethink development.

The program has the following components: 

Museum &amp; Education Programme &#x2013; Inspiring Future Generations.
Research &amp; Dialogue Programme &#x2013; Informing Policy.
Outreach Programme - Widening the Engagement.
To ensure that the property and premises of the U Thant House is well maintained and fully operational.</narrative>
  </description>
