  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">To broaden the horizons of youth and young adults in Myanmar by encouraging new thinking and introducing critical issues not sufficiently covered in the national curriculum (peace and tolerance and the need to safeguard our natural environment), and encourage reflection on how they apply to students&#x2019; daily lives in terms of upholding human dignity, challenging prejudice, and promoting nonviolence, and caring for the earth.</narrative>
   </title>
